"This logical equivalence is sometimes called **Proof by cases**. We'll use this a lot in the future. It basically tells us how to approach proofs where we have a hypothesis in the form a disjunction. We'll need two new laws of logic to pass this level. 🔍 Check out the entries for §0 and §1."
msgstr ""

