#: Game.Levels.EquivWorld.L04_equiv
msgid "In this case, §0 was applied to the **first instance** encountered where it could be applied. Specifically, Lean searched for the first instance of\n"
"§1\n"
"where the underscores are wildcards. The first underscore was matched to §2, the second to §3 and the third to §4. Lean then applied §5 to this instance. In particular, the left-hand side of our goal is now:\n"
"§6\n"
"It would be good to get this in the form:\n"
"§7\n"
"*☠ We might be tempted to try...*\n"
"§8\n"
"***But this will not work!*** Try it anyway, and notice what happens -- we get right back where we started! Don't worry, afterwards you can get back to this spot just by clicking **⌫ Retry**. 💡 Here's what actually works:\n"
"§9\n"
""
msgstr ""

